    <title>libfuse 3.17.1-rc0 Release Notes</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Release 3.17.1-rc0&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3.17.0 will not be officially released, as there was the 3.17 branch
&lt;br /&gt;which had a 3.17.0 version set by meson. In order to avoid all
&lt;br /&gt;possible issues, we advance to 3.17.1, for now as -rc0.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
